---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Your Name">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">About Me</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p>I didn't start out as a developer—I started out as a tinkerer.</p>
      <p>
        Growing up, I was the kid who took apart remote controls just to see how
        they worked. That curiosity eventually led me to a keyboard, where I
        discovered that code is the ultimate toolkit for creation. Today, I’m a
        developer who thrives on untangling complex logic and turning abstract
        ideas into fluid, interactive experiences.
      </p>
      <p>
        For me, development isn't just about writing functions; it's about
        crafting tools that make people's lives easier. Whether I'm optimizing a
        database query that shaves milliseconds off load times or designing a UI
        that feels intuitive on the first click, I believe that great software
        is invisible—it just works. When I’m not debugging, you’ll find me
        gaming, watching movies or tv shows, or going to the gym.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
